<title>USA: HA-LO to acquire advertising firm.</title>
<headline>HA-LO to acquire advertising firm.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc said Tuesday it has signed an agreement to acquire Creative Concepts In Advertising Inc, which has projected 1997 revenues of about $100 million.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Creative Concepts is a speciality advertising products and licensing company based in Beverly Hills, Mich.</p>
<p>HA-LO distributes advertising specialty and promotional products, and has marketing services including event planning, sports marketing, advertising and telemarketing services.</p>
